The PSD has announced when it will make the congress - what it will be decided then
Prime Minister Victor Ponta stated on Tuesday that it is important that at the PSD congress, beyond the election of the leadership, a clear message will be given if the government is to be continued or if the party decides to pass into opposition.
Dragnea: I’ll announce on Monday if I will run for office at the Congress
